# `pub publish` excludes every file ignored by .gitignore. The bundled web
# render worker is gitignored (issue #582 - it is a `dart compile js` build
# artifact, regenerated by tool/release.sh right before publishing rather than
# committed to git). Re-include it here so the published pub.dev archive still
# ships the prebuilt worker declared under `flutter: assets:` in pubspec.yaml.
#
# A .pubignore uses .gitignore syntax but applies only to `pub publish`, and a
# negation here overrides the root .gitignore for this package's tree. Without
# this line the published package would be missing its declared worker asset.
!assets/web/pdf_render_worker.dart.js
